DESCRIPTION:National Cheeseburger Day falls on September 18\, and its own o
 rigin is not well documented — no founding organization\, proclamation\,
  or first observance can be traced to the date. The sandwich it honors has
  a better-attested history\, though a contested one: several American rest
 aurants have claimed the invention\, and the oldest hard evidence for it i
 s not a claim at all but a Los Angeles menu from 1928.\n\nhttps://todaycel
 ebrates.com/holiday/national-cheeseburger-day/
